  "properties": {
    "title": "Global Farm Size, Version 1, 2000",
    "description": "The Global Farm Size, Version 1, 2000 is a global 8.4 km x 8.4 km gridded data set of dominant farm sizes derived from national-level data on farm size distributions and subnational data on field size distributions. The data set shows the global distribution of different sized farms.",
